WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:15.607 --> 00:00:18.440
(uplifting music)

00:00:29.350 --> 00:00:30.470
- [Narrator] Most of rural Kenya

00:00:30.470 --> 00:00:32.430
doesn't have access to electricity.

00:00:32.430 --> 00:00:35.091
This means the evenings
are full of darkness.

00:00:35.091 --> 00:00:37.930
Here, families rely on kerosene lamps,

00:00:37.930 --> 00:00:40.970
which are expensive and
produce harmful fumes.

00:00:40.970 --> 00:00:43.630
John Wangare wanted to change that.

00:00:43.630 --> 00:00:46.860
- My name is John Margiro Wangare.

00:00:46.860 --> 00:00:50.550
I am the found of Magiro
Mini Hydroelectric.

00:01:15.980 --> 00:01:18.260
- [Narrator] Inspired by the
dynamo on his brother's bicycle

00:01:18.260 --> 00:01:20.370
that generated light
once the wheel turned,

00:01:20.370 --> 00:01:22.010
John had an idea.

00:01:22.010 --> 00:01:24.600
What if that simple mechanism
could be made bigger?

00:01:24.600 --> 00:01:26.220
And what could turn that wheel?

00:01:40.830 --> 00:01:43.160
- [Narrator] From there, John
started to make his power plant

00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:44.888
with pieces of scrap.

00:01:44.888 --> 00:01:47.747
Using the river, John was
able to move the turbine,

00:01:47.747 --> 00:01:50.410
thus generating electricity.

00:01:50.410 --> 00:01:52.790
Slowly but surely, Magiro Power started

00:01:52.790 --> 00:01:54.340
to produce clean energy.

